            0.744,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Of course, to grow, we need food to eat, and especially in a large and diverse country like India, food is so fascinating. Across the country, we have different cuisines with their many tasty dishes. What are they made of? How do we find out?"
